+- GET /v1/jobs/{job_id}: existing queued/running/completed/failed result envelope.
+- GET /health: GPU-based HTTP status retained; CPU readiness is separate. With GPU disabled, 503 plus cpu_workflows.ready=true is expected. Health reports standalone / 4B visual / sdpa configuration, not proof that a model has loaded.
